---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---
<Layout title="Start a DSCR Loan Inquiry | YourBrokerPal" description="Start a conversation with YourBrokerPal about financing an investment property.">
<div class="page"><div class="kicker">GET STARTED</div><h1>Start with your property. We'll take it from there.</h1><p class="lead">Tell us a little about the investment you're considering. This first step is an inquiry, not a loan application or credit decision.</p><div class="apply-card"><h2>Request a secure application link</h2><p>Send a brief request and we'll follow up with next steps. We will provide a secure application method before requesting financial documents or sensitive personal information.</p><ul><li>Your name and best contact number</li><li>Property city and state</li><li>Purchase, rate &amp; term refinance, or cash-out refinance</li><li>Estimated property value and requested loan amount</li><li>Estimated monthly market rent, if known</li></ul><a class="button" href="mailto:brian@yourbrokerpal.com?subject=Request%20Secure%20DSCR%20Application%20Link&body=Name%3A%0APhone%3A%0AProperty%20City%2FState%3A%0ALoan%20Purpose%3A%0AEstimated%20Property%20Value%3A%0ARequested%20Loan%20Amount%3A%0AEstimated%20Monthly%20Rent%3A">Request My Application Link ↗</a></div><p class="fine">Please do not include Social Security numbers, dates of birth, bank statements, tax returns, or other sensitive documents in this email. A secure application and document-submission process must be used for that information.</p></div>
</Layout>
<style>.page{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:35px 0 70px}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#a47a3e;font-weight:800}.page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#10243c;margin:20px 0}.lead{font-size:18px;color:#617387;line-height:1.8}.apply-card{margin-top:30px;background:#f0f3f5;padding:30px}.apply-card h2{color:#10243c;margin:0 0 8px}.apply-card p,.apply-card li{color:#5f7184;font-size:15px}.apply-card ul{padding-left:22px;line-height:2;margin:20px 0}.button{display:inline-block;background:#c59a58;color:#10243c;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:14px 20px}.fine{font-size:13px;color:#778696;margin-top:20px}</style>